    <!-- Task E16/F02/US02/T01 (durable-queue-transport, ADR-027 §D11, ADR-002 w15 footer clause 2):
         the only Azure Storage SDK reference in this whole solution. AzureBlobDocumentStorage
         moved here from Raffa.Api/Infrastructure so Raffa.Worker can resolve IDocumentStorage too:
         the worker was the "landmine under any host-builder configuration that validates the DI
         graph eagerly" WorkerServiceCollectionExtensions.AddWorkerHost's own doc comment already
         named for IAuditWriter. This project is the Raffa.AiGateway shape: a provider adapter
         referenced by both hosts and by nothing else, not a bounded context (ADR-002 w15 footer):
         no DbContext, no migration, no .sql (ADR-027 §C10), so backend.yml's two script arrays stay
         untouched and w15's CI-YAML set stays zero files. -->
    <PackageReference Include="Azure.Storage.Blobs" Version="12.26.0" />
